# @hub-lanes

# ── PR RECORD SLOW SAFETY SWEEP (BH-9939, BH-9926 wave 7) ───────────────────
# bin/prr-sweep.sh tick — every 5 min. The line is a clock: a repo is swept
# only when its last sweep is PRR_SWEEP_INTERVAL_MIN (60) minutes old. A sweep
# compares the PR record with GitHub for the repo's open PRs, writes each
# difference through the normal record write (one PRR_SWEEP_FIX line), and
# renews the list sync stamp. It gates no other lane.
# Off via flags/lane-off-prr-sweep. Log: logs/prr-sweep.log.
*/5 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/prr-sweep.sh tick >/dev/null 2>&1
